<title>GERMANY: Hypo-Bank unit and Reuters cooperate.</title>
<headline>Hypo-Bank unit and Reuters cooperate.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Direkt Anlage Bank (DAB), the discount brokerage subsidiary of Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG, plans to offer its online customers a new information service in cooperation with Reuters.</p>
<p>DAB clients will in future be able to access market statistics, prices and Reuters news service via the Reuters Money Network, a software programme offered by Reuters subsidiary Reality, DAB said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
